    "detailed_description": "EPIC PIZZA - The People of Calzonia are hungry for Pizza. You have to Race against Time to get it to them. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat if there was an Action/Adventure Movie about Delivering Pizzas and You Were the Star?<br />\r\nWell, Now You can find out!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a fun and challenging Race Game.<br />\r\nYou have to Deliver Wave after Wave of Pizzas before the Clock Runs Out!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSee the Game Features Below:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Deliver Lots and Lots of Pizzas, but, Don't run out of Time!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Get rid of a Ninja Gang!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Enter a Race!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Go on a Mission!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Cool Minimap System!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Extra Bonus Challenge: Hidden in one of the Buildings is a Special Easter Egg. <br />\r\nCan You Find it?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* NOTE: Don't Fall into the Water or You will have to start all over again. *",
